# ==============================================================================
# AIDigiTools Content Intelligence & Autonomous SEO Agent V2
# Environment Configuration Template (.env.example)
#
# INSTRUCTIONS:
# Copy this file to .env:
#   cp .env.example .env
# Fill in your genuine credentials below. NEVER commit .env to source control!
